<title>UK: Suko, Esso keep two of four Brents turning wet.</title>
<headline>Suko, Esso keep two of four Brents turning wet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two of the four Brent cargoes turning wet on Friday were kept, one by Suko and the second by Esso, traders said.</p>
<p>Koch kept the third cargo but it was not clear if they bought it or got it through the chains.</p>
<p>One cargo was deferred to May 28-30, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom, +44 171 542 8145</p>
